      "worked_solution": "The red segment contains all values between  $-2$ and $2.$\n\n- the closed circle at $-2$ implies that $x$ can be equal to $-2,$ while\n\n- the closed circle at $2$ implies that $x$ can be equal to $2.$\n\nTherefore, the highlighted region represents $-2\\le x\\le 2.$",
